    "<section class=\"sec\"><header class=\"sec-h\"><h2>Capas</h2><span class=\"muted small\">": "<section class=\"sec\"><header class=\"sec-h\"><h2>Cloaks</h2><span class=\"muted small\">",
    "<p class=\"nota\">As capas comuns são só visuais e ficam para sempre. Saem das conquistas ou da Loja.</p><div class=\"equips\">": "<p class=\"nota\">Common cloaks are purely visual and are yours forever. They come from achievements or the Shop.</p><div class=\"equips\">",
    "<section class=\"sec\"><header class=\"sec-h\"><h2>Capas</h2></header><p class=\"nota\">Só mudam a aparência do domador. Compra única: continuam suas depois de renascer.</p><div class=\"ups\">": "<section class=\"sec\"><header class=\"sec-h\"><h2>Cloaks</h2></header><p class=\"nota\">They only change how the tamer looks. One-time purchase: still yours after you rebirth.</p><div class=\"ups\">",
